msgid ""
"Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the "
"Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must "
"install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more "
"information, see the [Samplomatic "
"documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang ilang halimbawa ng code sa pahinang ito ay gumagamit ng `samplex`, na "
"bahagi ng Samplomatic package. Samakatuwid, bago patakbuhin ang mga code "
"block na iyon, kailangan mong i-install ang Samplomatic, tulad ng "
"ipinapakita sa sumusunod na code block. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, "
"tingnan ang [dokumentasyon ng "
"Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Steps to use the Executor primitive {#steps-to-use-the-executor-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Mga hakbang para gamitin ang Executor primitive {#steps-to-use-the-executor-"
"primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. I-initialize ang account {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Qiskit Runtime is a managed service, you first need to initialize "
"your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the "
"expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil ang Qiskit Runtime ay isang managed na serbisyo, kailangan mo munang "
"i-initialize ang iyong account. Maaari kang pumili ng QPU na gusto mong "
"gamitin para kalkulahin ang expectation value.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; account](/guides/cloud-"
"setup) if you don't already have an account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga hakbang sa [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud&reg; "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup) kung wala ka pang account.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create and transpile a circuit {#2-create-and-transpile-a-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"2. Lumikha at mag-transpile ng circuit {#2-create-and-transpile-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You need at least one circuit to use the Executor primitive.  It can "
"optionally have parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kailangan mo ng kahit isang circuit para gamitin ang Executor primitive. "
"Opsyonal na magkaroon ito ng mga parameter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The circuit needs to be transformed to only use instructions supported by "
"the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use "
"the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang circuit ay kailangang i-transform para gumamit lamang ng mga tagubilin "
"na sinusuportahan ng QPU (tinatawag na *instruction set architecture (ISA)* "
"circuit). Gamitin ang transpiler para gawin ito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Initialize a `QuantumProgram` {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"
msgstr ""
"3. I-initialize ang isang `QuantumProgram` {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize a `QuantumProgram` with your workload. A `QuantumProgram` is made"
" up of `QuantumProgramItems`. Typically, each item consists of a circuit, a "
"set of parameter values, and possibly a `samplex` to randomize the circuit "
"content. For full details, see [Executor inputs and "
"outputs](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr ""
"I-initialize ang isang `QuantumProgram` kasama ang iyong workload. Ang isang"
" `QuantumProgram` ay binubuo ng mga `QuantumProgramItem`. Karaniwan, ang "
"bawat item ay binubuo ng isang circuit, isang set ng mga halaga ng "
"parameter, at posibleng isang `samplex` para gawing random ang nilalaman ng "
"circuit. Para sa buong detalye, tingnan ang [Mga input at output ng "
"Executor](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following cell initializes a `QuantumProgram` and specifies to perform "
"25 shots. Next, it appends the transpiled target circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang sumusunod na cell ay nag-i-initialize ng isang `QuantumProgram` at "
"nagtatakda na magsagawa ng 25 shot. Susunod, ini-append nito ang transpiled "
"na target na circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Optional: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes {#4-optional-"
"group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"
msgstr ""
"4. Opsyonal: Grupuhin ang mga gate at measurement sa mga annotated na box "
"{#4-optional-group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grouping instructions into boxes and annotating them is the primary way to "
"specify your intent. In the following example, we use "
"`generate_boxing_pass_manager` and its twirling parameters to group two-"
"qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply twirling annotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pag-grupo ng mga tagubilin sa mga box at pag-annotate sa mga ito ay ang "
"pangunahing paraan para tukuyin ang iyong intent. Sa sumusunod na halimbawa,"
" ginagamit namin ang `generate_boxing_pass_manager` at ang mga parameter ng "
"twirling nito para grupuhin ang mga two-qubit gate at mga measurement sa mga"
" box at mag-apply ng twirling annotation.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-"
"executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-"
"executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Optional: Build a template circuit and samplex, and add them to the "
"program {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-to-"
"the-program}"
msgstr ""
"5. Opsyonal: Bumuo ng template circuit at samplex, at idagdag ang mga ito sa"
" program {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-to-"
"the-program}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, use the Samplomatic "
"[build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build)"
" method to generate the _template circuit_ and _samplex_ pair. The template "
"circuit is structurally equivalent to the original circuit. However, its "
"single-qubit gates are replaced by parameterized gates in order to implement"
" the prescribed annotations (gate and measurement twirling, in this "
"example). The samplex encodes all the information required to generate "
"randomized parameters for the template circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Susunod, gamitin ang Samplomatic "
"[build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build)"
" method para makabuo ng pares ng _template circuit_ at _samplex_. Ang "
"template circuit ay katumbas sa istruktura ng orihinal na circuit. "
"Gayunpaman, ang mga single-qubit gate nito ay pinapalitan ng mga "
"parameterized gate para ipatupad ang mga itinakdang annotation (gate at "
"measurement twirling, sa halimbawang ito). Ine-encode ng samplex ang lahat "
"ng impormasyong kinakailangan para makabuo ng mga randomized na parameter "
"para sa template circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After generating the template circuit and samplex pair, use the "
"`append_samplex_item` method to add the pair to the program.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos makabuo ng pares ng template circuit at samplex, gamitin ang "
"method na `append_samplex_item` para idagdag ang pares sa program.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the Samplomatic "
"[API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html) documentation for"
" full details about `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` and its arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang dokumentasyon ng Samplomatic "
"[API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html) para sa buong "
"detalye tungkol sa `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` at ang mga argumento "
"nito.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. Invoke Executor and get results {#6-invoke-executor-and-get-results}"
msgstr ""
"6. I-invoke ang Executor at makuha ang mga resulta {#6-invoke-executor-and-"
"get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the `QuantumProgram` on an IBM&reg; backend by using the `Executor` "
"primitive with default options. See [Executor options](/guides/executor-"
"options) to learn about the available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Patakbuhin ang `QuantumProgram` sa isang IBM&reg; backend sa pamamagitan ng "
"paggamit ng `Executor` primitive na may mga default na opsyon. Tingnan ang "
"[Mga opsyon ng Executor](/guides/executor-options) para malaman ang tungkol "
"sa mga available na opsyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result is of type "
"[`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/results-quantum-program-result). See [Executor input and "
"output](/guides/executor-input-output) to learn about the result object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang resulta ay may uri na "
"[`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/results-quantum-program-result). Tingnan ang [Mga input at output ng"
" Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) para malaman ang tungkol sa result"
" object.\n"

